                    <hi rendition="#italic">Post</hi>, <ref target="#pg1113">p. 1113</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d296-f2" n="2" xml:id="d296-f2-content">
                <p>Secretary Marshall was planning to go to Paris to attend the meeting of the
                    United Nations General Assembly.</p>
            </note>
